  "View Live Demo": "Voir la démo en direct",
  "Easy Badge Creation and Customization ": "Création et personnalisation faciles des badges ",
  "Creating and customizing product badges is a breeze with our intuitive interface. You can effortlessly design badges that align with your brand’s aesthetics and marketing goals. Whether you want to emphasize a \"New Arrival,\" \"Best Seller,\" \"Limited Edition,\" or any other key attribute, our module allows you to tailor the text and imagery to perfectly match your promotional strategy. This flexibility ensures that your product badges are not only visually appealing but also highly effective in communicating your messages.": "Créer et personnaliser des badges de produits est un jeu d'enfant grâce à notre interface intuitive. ",
  "Seamless Integration with Your Store": "Intégration transparente avec votre magasin",
  "Once created, product badges are seamlessly integrated into your storefront. They appear prominently on product images, ensuring that they capture the attention of your customers as they browse through your offerings. This seamless integration means that there is no disruption to the shopping experience; instead, it enhances it by providing clear, concise information at a glance. This not only aids in the decision-making process but also adds a professional touch to your product listings.": "Une fois créés, les badges produits sont parfaitement intégrés à votre vitrine. ",
  "Robust Backend Management": "Gestion back-end robuste",
  "Managing your product badges from the backend is both simple and efficient. The Product Badge Management module offers a comprehensive dashboard where you can easily add, edit, or remove badges as needed. This centralized management system allows you to keep your badges up-to-date and relevant to your current promotions and inventory status. Additionally, the module supports bulk actions, enabling you to apply badges to multiple products simultaneously, saving you time and effort.": "La gestion de vos badges produits depuis le backend est à la fois simple et efficace. ",
  "Boosting Sales and Customer Engagement": "Stimuler les ventes et l’engagement client",
  "The strategic use of product badges can significantly boost sales and enhance customer engagement. By clearly highlighting product features, promotions, and unique selling points, badges help guide customers towards making informed purchasing decisions. This increased visibility can lead to higher conversion rates and improved overall shopping experiences. Furthermore, well-designed badges add a layer of professionalism to your store, helping to build trust and credibility with your customers.": "L'utilisation stratégique des badges de produits peut augmenter considérablement les ventes et améliorer l'engagement des clients. ",
